                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "The data was recorded from primary school children visiting a VR simulation. It contains questionnaire data on knowledge (about space), and the overview effect. It also contains drawings as a measure of awe, and ratings for awe for these drawings."
                }
              }
            ]
          },
